DEMONSTRATION ONLY - August 2017 Terai flood, Bara-Parsa, Nepal, from Sentinel-1 radar with the unchanged Sunamganj method. Only 3 of 8 radar dates could be mapped (16, 20 and 28 Aug); the main flood peak (11-14 Aug) could not, so the pipeline own check says NO-GO and no pre-peak map exists. The area was chosen where the radar showed the most flood water. NOT VALIDATED against an independent flood map; OSM shelter candidates are not verified shelters. Follow official flood alerts (DHM, NDRRMA).